 ## Mapscripts
 
-- Modify **Highlands** so it supports AdvCiv-SAS's new world sizes. Also increase its players supported from 18 to 48+ (for the 48 civs DLL). Change in the new [Highlands.py](/PrivateMaps/Highlands.py). Grid size **computed dynamically beyond Huge**. See [SAS_WorldSizes.py](/PrivateMaps/SAS_WorldSizes.py). See also: [Modding ressources (Mapscripts)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/Modding_Ressources/README.md#mapscripts).
